{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202655IZe6YSfO1792710952.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有發展商看好新盤市場表現，預期全年成交額將創九年新高。</p><p></p><p>新鴻基地產副董事總經理雷霆說︰「下半年三、四季，我們見到最近行家的樓盤賣得好。我們賣得好，有幾個樓盤都可以講枕戈待發，相信三、四季樓市會非常熱鬧。我預計今年一手成交額有機會達到2,300萬元、即是打破九年前的紀錄。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.429635+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:17.097268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T00:17:58.992276+00:00","content_hash":"6cc14f43a94e7702e19a2448b11d82665059cb7b8987641298edfde4b0b930f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.429635+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}